<p class="lede">Kerntemperaturen für Fleisch und Fisch, dazu die Rauchpunkte der Öle im Überblick.</p>

<div class="block">
  <div class="section-label">Kerntemperatur · Fleisch &amp; Fisch</div>
  <div class="ratio-grid">
    <div class="ratio-item heat"><span class="r-label">Rind / Lamm</span><div class="r-value">55–62 °C</div><div class="r-sub">Medium Rare bis Medium</div></div>
    <div class="ratio-item heat"><span class="r-label">Schwein</span><div class="r-value">63–70 °C</div><div class="r-sub">rosa-saftig bis durch</div></div>
    <div class="ratio-item heat"><span class="r-label">Geflügel</span><div class="r-value">72–74 °C</div><div class="r-sub">immer ganz durch</div></div>
    <div class="ratio-item heat"><span class="r-label">Hackfleisch</span><div class="r-value">70–72 °C</div><div class="r-sub">immer ganz durch</div></div>
    <div class="ratio-item heat"><span class="r-label">Fisch</span><div class="r-value">50–55 °C</div><div class="r-sub">glasig bis gerade gar</div></div>
  </div>
</div>

